  "releaseNotes": "1.0.5 — Expose top-level seatsAvailable on mt_packages (from customFields/metaDataDictionary) so list/detail consumers can read remaining seats after JSON round-trip. Also fully decouple from the legacy net3000 monolith (applications#1543): shared credential DTOs moved to net3000.common.models 1.0.18. 1.0.4 — Fix package detail pricing dropping out on consumer sites after JSON round-trip. 1.0.3 — Rebuilt against net3000.common 10.0.21. 1.0.2 — Stop leaking netlibCore via PrivateAssets=\"all\" (CS0433 fix). 1.0.1 — Fix TwilioService PackageId (NU1101). 1.0.0 — Initial release.",
